# G7: the pull-down menus drawn in graphics. Select a word, then walk the bar: File, Edit (Cut and Copy are live with a selection), Find,
# Character before and after Italic (the check mark), Paragraph (a check on Left), View (checks, the Zoom arrow) and Help; then leave
# through File > Exit, which asks about the italic. Played into QUILLDOS.EXE with /G16 and /G, and on the host through quill-paint.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
f8 right right right right right
f10 down down
right down down down
right right down down
right right down
right
f10 right right right right down down enter     # Character > Italic
f10 right right right right down down
right down down
right right down
right
right
esc
f10 right right right right right right right down
esc
f10 end enter
right
enter
